## 412. 偶奇 sector

```lean
theorem evenOddOmega_dirichlet_decomposition
    {s : ℂ} (hs : 1 < s.re) :
    evenOmegaSeries s =
      (riemannZeta s +
        riemannZeta (2 * s) / riemannZeta s) / 2 ∧
    oddOmegaSeries s =
      (riemannZeta s -
        riemannZeta (2 * s) / riemannZeta s) / 2
```

